[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document provides the full test protocol (a full collection of test cases) for the Main Control
Application Firmware for the Heracles 1.0 system.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This report contains a detailed test description to conduct verification testing of Heracles 1.0 Main
Control Application Firmware that covers Heracles Main Control Application FW SRS.
<<<

