PREREQUISITES: >>>
1. The system is ready to run without any issues
2. The treatment plan is uploaded and ready to run / emission
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Start running the emission for the uploaded plan
2. Check the LED color of the head ring
3. After the emission is finished, check the LED color of the Head interface
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
1. Verify the emission started
2. Verify the color of the LED of the head ring is changing accordingly via communication of firmware and head interface board
3. Verify the color of the LED of the head ring is changing accordingly via communication of firmware and head interface board after emission ends
<<<

