2. Verify it's in COLD state
3. Verify the warmup is started
4. Verify the logs are displayed in the screen
5. Verify the warmup was not successful
6. Verify the state of the system is COLD
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H1FWMC-41
  ROLE: Verifies

